                      "id": "e8Ty4",
                      "fill": "#64748B",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": 500,
                      "content": "Flag blurry and duplicate images. Score photos by technical quality. Sort by sharpness and exposure. Treat every shoot the same way. Miss the photos that actually matter.",
