          "y": 1510,
          "fill": "#3C3C4399",
          "content": "• Entrance: opacity 0→1 + translateY(150px→0) — scroll-triggered IntersectionObserver\n• Window mockups: scale(0.5)→1 + blur-sm→none on background panels\n• Collaboration cursors: translate3d(±400px, ±600px, 0) → final position\n• Hover: opacity 0.7→1 on nav links, transition-colors on buttons\n• Partner logos: horizontal auto-scroll marquee\n• Frosted glass: backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(200%)",
          "lineHeight": 1.8,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
