        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "gj76c",
          "x": 48,
          "y": 960,
          "fill": "#666666",
          "content": "iOS APP ICONS: 80×80px, fill: accent or dark, cornerRadius: 20px, Lucide icon 36×36 centered\n  Used for: Upload, Gallery, Contracts — floating on canvas with 'X files' label below\n\nFLOATING CARDS: white bg, 12-16px radius, no border, positioned freely on dot-pattern canvas\n  Connected by curved dotted lines (bezier paths between cards)\n\nSIDE PANEL: Knowledge/Efficiency stat boxes (white, 12px radius), task/message badges (#E8390E circle)\n\nTRAINING BAR: progress indicator with percentage, 'Train Sort AI →' dark pill button\n\nKANJI COUNTER: Japanese character (侍) used as stat display at 48-56px — cultural texture element\n\nDOT PATTERN: subtle repeating dots on canvas background for spatial/graph-paper feel",
          "lineHeight": 1.8,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
    },
