          "x": 48,
          "y": 1320,
          "fill": "#888888",
          "content": "HEADLINE COMPOSITION:\n  Bold all-caps + pill-outlined emphasis word (e.g. 'IMPROVE YOUR WORK WITH THE POWER OF [AI PHOTO SORTING]')\n  Pill word: same weight/size as headline, wrapped in rounded-full 2px black stroke container\n\nSCATTERED IMAGE LAYOUT:\n  Hero images placed asymmetrically — different sizes, overlapping edges, varying y-positions\n  Badge labels ('DISCOVER →', 'TOP RATED') float near image edges\n  Stat badges (e.g. '17k+ CUSTOMERS') float as small cards in the composition\n\nSERVICE LIST:\n  Full-width rows with numbered prefix (01, 02, 03), title, and right-aligned CTA button\n  Stacked vertically with 1px border between rows\n\nMOBILE COMPANION: right-aligned mobile mockup showing same content adapted for phone viewport",
          "lineHeight": 1.8,
          "fontFamily": "Inter",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        }
      ]
